    <statement><p>Find the equation of the tangent plane to the surface <m>z = 4 y^{2} -
1 x^{2}</m> at the point <m>\left( 0, -2, 16 \right)</m>.</p>
<p>z = <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Note: Your answer should be an expression of x and y; e.g. <lq/>3x - 4y + 6<rq/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0x+\left(-16\right)y+\left(-16\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
